  {
   "id": "mythwrecked-ambrosia-island-223097@1.07",
   "gameId": "mythwrecked-ambrosia-island-223097",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.07",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2024-12-20T08:59:55.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi, we’re still very solid with very few bug reports coming in, which is great! I've caught a few things internally so done a v1.07 patch (v1.05 and v1.06 were internal, hence the jump in version number) with the following fixes:-",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Edge case blocker bug where you can save after placing the final soulstone before triggering the endgame finale. On reload of that save, the endgame finale would not trigger.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you entered the South-Western beach at exactly 5am then the stars would remain in the sky for the rest of the day in that location.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "On very old PCs/Laptops we've had a report of the player character remaining tiny when emerging from fast travel. We can't replicate this, even on a 15 year-old laptop, but have made a change that we think will fix the issue.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Save benches, the mosaic and the chillout blanket did not have a highlight in the Atrium scene",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a couple of minor visual bugs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "That's it! Thanks for playing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
